# Pinned PostgREST for the Option G HTTP integration test (scripts/ops-health-gated-rpc-tests.sh). Used ONLY against a throwaway local PostgreSQL.
# The test refuses to run if the downloaded asset's sha256 differs from this pin. To bump: change all three values together, re-run the test, and cross-check the
# sha256 against the digest GitHub shows next to the asset on https://github.com/PostgREST/postgrest/releases (the pin below was computed from the downloaded asset;
# GitHub's API was not reachable from the authoring environment, so this independent cross-check is an OWNER ACTION, see docs/ops-bot/reporting-gated-rpc.md).
POSTGREST_VERSION=v12.2.12
POSTGREST_ASSET=postgrest-v12.2.12-linux-static-x86-64.tar.xz
POSTGREST_SHA256=5de4092f1719da3353c40bf96c8dec6913f2254a7cd0b61cc05f233153b557d5
